@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@clientToken = {{login_client.response.body.token}}

### Login come cliente
# @name login_client
POST {{baseUrl}}/auths/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mario.rossi@example.com",
  "password": "Azqwazqw1@"
}

### Effettuare una prenotazione
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservation/reserve
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### Ottenere la lista delle prenotazioni
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservation/list
Authorization: eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJhdXRoMCIsImVtYWlsIjoibWFyaW8ucm9zc2lAZXhhbXBsZS5jb20iLCJpYXQiOjE3NDQ4OTI0NzAsImV4cCI6MTc0NDk3ODg3MH0.zW7ikDGh2oWc4BcIlYWTVedDTGStx8BuXF6iSbS0-ZU

### Cambiare lo stato di una prenotazione a PENDING
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservation/toPending
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

{
  "reservationId": 1
}

### Cambiare lo stato di una prenotazione a CONFIRMED
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservation/toConfirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reservationId": 1
}

### Cambiare lo stato di una prenotazione a CANCELLED
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservation/toCancel
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

{
  "reservationId": 1
}